        },
        {
          "body": "Eastern said on April 27, 2023 that its board of directors declared a regular quarterly dividend of $0.11 per share ($0.44 annualized). Previously, the company paid $0.11 per share. Shares must be purchased before the ex-div date of May 12, 2023 to qualify for the dividend. Shareholders of record as of May 15, 2023 will receive the payment on June 15, 2023. At the current share price of $17.75 / share, the stock's dividend yield is 2.48%. Looking back five years and taking a sample every week, the average dividend yield has been 1.83%, the lowest has been 1.33%, and the highest has been 2.62%. The standard deviation of yields is 0.31 (n=236). The current dividend yield is 2.09 standard deviations above the historical average. Additionally, the company's dividend payout ratio is 0.22. The payout ratio tells us how much of a company's income is paid out in dividends. A payout ratio of one…",
